WEBVTT

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:25.430
Let Hae Soo go. Now!

00:00:25.430 --> 00:00:30.600
Wolves are known for
that all their lives they love only one she-wolf

00:00:31.690 --> 00:00:33.890
After all, you're just an animal

00:00:34.890 --> 00:00:36.030
Out!

00:00:37.160 --> 00:00:47.160
Project coordinator and song translator: Nemie

00:00:39.580 --> 00:00:41.060
Make a choice

00:00:41.630 --> 00:00:42.910
Hae Soo

00:00:43.330 --> 00:00:46.300
or a dead emperor?

00:00:47.260 --> 00:00:57.260
Translators: Nemie, Kaia

00:00:57.360 --> 00:01:07.360
Beta editor and typesetter: Nemie

00:01:43.960 --> 00:01:46.600
Hail the new emperor

00:01:48.660 --> 00:01:52.450
Long live... Long live...

00:01:55.020 --> 00:01:56.340
Long live the emperor

00:02:11.000 --> 00:02:13.960
Episode 15

00:02:18.460 --> 00:02:19.780
Chi Mon

00:02:21.030 --> 00:02:26.310
Empress Yu said I should be glad she had a miscarriage

00:02:27.400 --> 00:02:31.700
Choi Chi Mon

00:02:27.400 --> 00:02:31.700
Wang So

00:02:27.400 --> 00:02:31.700
Crown Prince Mu

00:02:27.710 --> 00:02:31.430
I was looking forward to the arrival of my little brother

00:02:33.730 --> 00:02:37.020
It would be better if instead of me, a man with a meager pedigree,

00:02:37.020 --> 00:02:39.600
Tae became crown prince

00:02:39.610 --> 00:02:41.640
Don't say that!

00:02:41.640 --> 00:02:45.190
I told you that you were born under the star of the emperor in the constellation Hongwon!

00:02:45.190 --> 00:02:46.420
Is it true?

00:02:46.420 --> 00:02:47.720
Of course

00:02:51.740 --> 00:02:53.020
That's just...

00:02:56.320 --> 00:02:58.210
Mu...

00:02:58.210 --> 00:03:01.670
What... if...

00:03:02.640 --> 00:03:05.940
Is your life not that long?

00:03:07.110 --> 00:03:08.300
What do you say?

00:03:11.940 --> 00:03:13.540
What difference does it make if so?

00:03:14.230 --> 00:03:17.980
Much more important is who I will spend my last days with

00:03:23.860 --> 00:03:29.380
Brother, I also want to become an emperor

00:03:30.080 --> 00:03:32.000
Of course you will too

00:03:32.000 --> 00:03:35.550
Our prince Wang So was also born under the emperor's star

00:03:35.550 --> 00:03:37.160
Really, Chi Mon?

00:03:37.160 --> 00:03:40.370
So, will I also become an emperor?

00:03:40.370 --> 00:03:43.700
Hooray! I will become an emperor!

00:03:44.390 --> 00:03:47.840
Come on! You should call me "Your Majesty"

00:03:48.800 --> 00:03:51.800
Yes, Your Majesty.
Forgive us, Your Majesty

00:03:59.810 --> 00:04:01.550
He's the emperor

00:04:04.650 --> 00:04:06.040
This man

00:04:08.120 --> 00:04:10.430
emperor of our nation

00:04:13.760 --> 00:04:16.090
Are you going to leave it like this?

00:04:32.680 --> 00:04:33.780
Brother...

00:04:37.200 --> 00:04:38.520
Forget everything

00:04:40.660 --> 00:04:42.380
Rest in peace

00:05:07.900 --> 00:05:09.160
Everything happened

00:05:12.520 --> 00:05:13.860
because of me

00:05:17.810 --> 00:05:19.410
I'm sorry

00:05:21.870 --> 00:05:23.310
So...

00:05:35.300 --> 00:05:36.960
Where are you going, brother?

00:05:39.230 --> 00:05:40.290
Get out of my way

00:05:41.070 --> 00:05:43.480
The new emperor ordered to convey

00:05:43.480 --> 00:05:47.410
If Senior Lady Hae Soo leaves Damiwon,

00:05:47.720 --> 00:05:51.950
It will be announced throughout Koryo that she poisoned the emperor.

00:05:53.160 --> 00:05:55.520
Then she won't run far

00:06:04.570 --> 00:06:07.360
Residence of the 10th Prince

00:06:22.640 --> 00:06:24.600
Wang Gue, grandfather of the 10th Prince

00:06:23.320 --> 00:06:24.680
Scoundrels!

00:06:27.940 --> 00:06:31.130
We caught Wang Gyu, but didn't find the 10th Prince

00:06:31.130 --> 00:06:32.050
Wang Sik Ryom

00:06:34.290 --> 00:06:35.850
We have to grab him

00:06:37.250 --> 00:06:39.080
Find him. Fast!

00:06:39.080 --> 00:06:40.140
Eat!

00:06:46.970 --> 00:06:49.810
Let go. Let go, scoundrels!

00:06:50.530 --> 00:06:52.950
Why is the Emperor doing this to me?

00:06:52.950 --> 00:06:55.600
Let me see him!

00:06:55.600 --> 00:06:59.360
Your Majesty! Your Majesty!

00:06:59.360 --> 00:07:02.560
Your Majesty!

00:07:02.560 --> 00:07:05.490
Park Sul Hee will be exiled

00:07:05.690 --> 00:07:09.440
Let's say that Wang Gue planned
high treason and killed Park Sul-hee

00:07:09.440 --> 00:07:10.700
Well done

00:07:11.870 --> 00:07:13.880
You treated Brother Mu well

00:07:13.880 --> 00:07:17.020
And thanks for telling me to use Hae Soo to get to Seo

00:07:18.100 --> 00:07:20.080
Now I believe that you are on my side

00:07:21.890 --> 00:07:26.700
Without you, uncle, Uk would not have come over to my side

00:07:27.920 --> 00:07:30.390
Shouldn't you bow to the emperor?

00:07:51.070 --> 00:07:52.820
Greetings, Your Majesty

00:07:52.820 --> 00:07:55.560
Long live the emperor

00:08:33.800 --> 00:08:36.360
Eun and his wife ran away

00:08:36.560 --> 00:08:41.020
To carry out Wang Gu's rebellion,
we have to catch Eun

00:08:41.460 --> 00:08:42.890
Need to kill him

00:08:44.540 --> 00:08:46.230
Don't worry

00:08:46.230 --> 00:08:51.110
Do you have a dog that can catch them?

00:09:04.370 --> 00:09:05.710
What's wrong with my grandson?

00:09:05.710 --> 00:09:10.010
Let my Eun live, please!

00:09:24.150 --> 00:09:26.170
I knew this day would come

00:09:28.150 --> 00:09:31.550
You've been a perfect child since birth

00:09:31.550 --> 00:09:34.140
I foresaw that you would bring me great fame

00:09:35.050 --> 00:09:36.640
Our Emperor

00:09:36.640 --> 00:09:40.130
Congratulations on being named Empress Dowager

00:09:41.560 --> 00:09:44.790
Take care of the other princes quickly

00:09:45.360 --> 00:09:47.580
This is the only way order will be restored in the palace.

00:09:47.580 --> 00:09:50.520
- Also...
- I will take care of political affairs

00:09:50.520 --> 00:09:52.700
Koryo is now in our hands

00:09:53.290 --> 00:09:57.420
You should live your life enjoying the beautiful things that life offers you.

00:09:59.600 --> 00:10:00.940
Yo...

00:10:02.770 --> 00:10:03.870
Hurry up

00:10:12.060 --> 00:10:13.950
Show your manners to the Emperor!

00:10:14.990 --> 00:10:16.850
Don't be so heartless

00:10:17.790 --> 00:10:21.480
I'm alive thanks to him

00:10:25.700 --> 00:10:29.840
You... held back when you wanted to stab me

00:10:31.560 --> 00:10:34.320
Letting doubts get in the way

00:10:43.690 --> 00:10:48.220
If you feel regret, I can finish what I started

00:10:49.260 --> 00:10:50.370
You!

00:10:53.220 --> 00:10:57.030
Wang Gu tried to put the 10th prince on the throne,

00:10:57.030 --> 00:10:58.520
he was sentenced to death

00:11:00.170 --> 00:11:01.290
Catch the Prince

00:11:02.500 --> 00:11:06.500
If you catch me, you can kill me on the spot.

00:11:06.500 --> 00:11:08.670
Was the last emperor not enough?

00:11:10.910 --> 00:11:13.120
I won't do this

00:11:13.120 --> 00:11:14.530
Won't you do it?

00:11:18.190 --> 00:11:19.680
This is the emperor's order

00:11:20.830 --> 00:11:24.180
Then Baek Ah, Choi Chi Mon

00:11:26.040 --> 00:11:27.510
and even Hae Soo

00:11:28.480 --> 00:11:30.770
All those whom you consider to be your people,

00:11:33.380 --> 00:11:34.520
will be safe

00:11:37.150 --> 00:11:41.240
After all, you have already become a dog that will run after our relatives

00:11:57.840 --> 00:12:01.100
I asked you not to keep him around! Get rid of him!

00:12:01.100 --> 00:12:03.280
It's a lot of fun to tame him, so why?

00:12:08.570 --> 00:12:10.560
Thinking of pitying me?

00:12:11.850 --> 00:12:13.520
Is he eyeing me?

00:12:14.990 --> 00:12:16.290
What kind of arrogance is this?

00:12:33.370 --> 00:12:38.140
Wang Gu and his family were executed

00:12:42.470 --> 00:12:47.140
The Emperor ordered me to find Eun and his wife

00:12:50.520 --> 00:12:54.750
He didn't order them killed, did he?

00:13:03.000 --> 00:13:05.540
Listen to me carefully, your highness

00:13:06.860 --> 00:13:13.390
Emperor Taejo and I have had a strong bond since the founding of Goryeo.

00:13:14.190 --> 00:13:18.390
We fought to the death and I remain loyal to him

00:13:21.370 --> 00:13:22.660
But it's wrong

00:13:25.450 --> 00:13:27.310
Don't hurt my daughter

00:13:29.020 --> 00:13:31.970
If my daughter gets caught up in a fight between brothers,

00:13:32.680 --> 00:13:34.870
I, Park Soo Kyung, will not sit idly by

00:13:53.870 --> 00:13:56.040
I'm fine

00:13:56.040 --> 00:13:57.600
What about you?

00:13:57.600 --> 00:13:59.310
Nothing happened to you, did it?

00:13:59.310 --> 00:14:03.410
It's true that the emperor died due to mercury poisoning

00:14:03.940 --> 00:14:08.450
Until we know who's behind this, don't trust anyone

00:14:14.850 --> 00:14:17.020
I'll leave the palace for a while

00:14:17.590 --> 00:14:19.370
I'm afraid to leave you alone

00:14:21.060 --> 00:14:24.130
Stay as far away from the Emperor and Empress as possible

00:14:24.730 --> 00:14:27.900
If anything happens, go straight to Choi Chi Mon

00:14:28.160 --> 00:14:30.270
Where are you going?

00:14:34.870 --> 00:14:38.750
The Emperor wants me to catch the criminal who committed treason

00:14:38.840 --> 00:14:41.440
Was he blackmailing you with me again?

00:14:44.850 --> 00:14:47.450
I'll figure it out

00:14:58.190 --> 00:15:00.660
Only you and I were next to the emperor

00:15:01.580 --> 00:15:04.850
Is it the water or the medicinal herbs...

00:15:05.560 --> 00:15:08.040
No one else touched them, so why?

00:15:08.910 --> 00:15:10.140
Mercury?

00:15:10.140 --> 00:15:11.480
It's not me

00:15:12.090 --> 00:15:13.300
It's true

00:15:14.830 --> 00:15:16.910
Did you think that I suspect you?

00:15:19.220 --> 00:15:20.830
You have to be careful too

00:15:20.830 --> 00:15:23.340
The 3rd Prince has always been a scary person

00:15:23.940 --> 00:15:26.650
The 10th Prince's family is accused of treason

00:15:26.650 --> 00:15:29.190
His mother and relatives...

00:15:30.330 --> 00:15:32.100
they were all executed

00:15:32.100 --> 00:15:33.170
What?

00:15:35.000 --> 00:15:38.030
And the prince? What's wrong with him?

00:15:41.250 --> 00:15:45.200
I'll leave the palace for a while

00:15:45.760 --> 00:15:47.870
I'm afraid to leave you alone

00:15:47.870 --> 00:15:51.750
The Emperor wants me to catch the criminal who committed treason

00:15:52.790 --> 00:15:55.720
So, the person the 4th prince must catch...

00:16:04.370 --> 00:16:06.330
Madam? Madam?

00:16:24.310 --> 00:16:26.180
Su, it's me

00:16:42.360 --> 00:16:45.350
The new emperor won't know if we hide here

00:16:46.730 --> 00:16:50.250
The prince said we can trust you

00:16:51.690 --> 00:16:53.460
Don't learn anything

00:16:53.460 --> 00:16:56.110
Otherwise you will die

00:16:56.110 --> 00:16:57.770
Ay, stop it

00:16:59.360 --> 00:17:03.180
Anyway, Su, don't worry.

00:17:03.180 --> 00:17:06.940
We will remain here until the ship departs.

00:17:06.940 --> 00:17:08.790
Where will you sail?

00:17:09.150 --> 00:17:10.690
- We...
- Enough!

00:17:12.300 --> 00:17:15.400
You don't need to know.
Just make sure we don't get caught

00:17:15.400 --> 00:17:17.040
Don't tell anyone about us

00:17:17.630 --> 00:17:20.960
Okay, I'll be very careful

00:17:21.960 --> 00:17:25.930
But wouldn't it be better to get help from the brothers?

00:17:27.020 --> 00:17:29.330
Yes, from Uka

00:17:29.330 --> 00:17:31.050
Or from Baek Ah and Jeong?

00:17:31.050 --> 00:17:33.590
It can't be that they won't help me

00:17:34.310 --> 00:17:37.840
- Even So was at my birthday
- No!

00:17:41.560 --> 00:17:42.720
Because...

00:17:45.230 --> 00:17:49.650
The 4th prince is looking for you now

00:17:51.640 --> 00:17:53.640
We can't tell anyone

00:17:53.640 --> 00:17:56.080
After all, it is unknown when everything will be revealed

00:17:56.080 --> 00:17:59.260
Let's take a wrong step and that's it

00:17:59.260 --> 00:18:01.150
I understand

00:18:03.890 --> 00:18:05.160
By the way, Su

00:18:06.290 --> 00:18:10.080
What happened to my mom and aunt?

00:18:12.620 --> 00:18:13.900
I don't know

00:18:14.900 --> 00:18:17.780
I don't know what's going on outside of Damiwon

00:18:20.270 --> 00:18:22.840
It bothers me that I couldn't take them with me.

00:18:23.840 --> 00:18:25.800
I hope they were able to escape

00:18:39.460 --> 00:18:42.740
I thought you were a simple gisaeng
who wanted to avenge her parents

00:18:43.970 --> 00:18:46.200
And you were the princess of Hubaekje

00:18:47.340 --> 00:18:49.980
You hid a lot from me

00:18:51.290 --> 00:18:54.190
I think this could be used against you, Your Majesty.

00:18:54.190 --> 00:18:57.910
Please allow the Hupaekje people to occupy the southern territories

00:18:57.910 --> 00:19:01.200
Let them till the land
for three years without paying tribute

00:19:01.200 --> 00:19:03.680
Liberate those who were forcibly made slaves

00:19:03.680 --> 00:19:05.670
Restore law-abiding citizens to their status

00:19:05.670 --> 00:19:08.660
And let them till the land

00:19:09.530 --> 00:19:12.100
You tried to kill the emperor

00:19:12.800 --> 00:19:15.130
Why should I trust you?

00:19:15.130 --> 00:19:17.240
If my people are hungry,

00:19:17.240 --> 00:19:20.200
revenge means nothing to me

00:19:21.650 --> 00:19:23.680
If you help them survive,

00:19:23.680 --> 00:19:27.580
the people of Hupakje recognize you as emperor

00:19:29.670 --> 00:19:31.330
They will become your loyal subjects

00:19:38.200 --> 00:19:39.370
Yes...

00:19:40.740 --> 00:19:44.940
But no matter how much I think about it,

00:19:44.940 --> 00:19:47.280
I feel like I'm going to lose from this

00:19:51.230 --> 00:19:53.190
I have a tempting offer

00:20:02.250 --> 00:20:06.880
I heard the 4th prince, this dog will try to kill his brother

00:20:08.360 --> 00:20:11.250
Shut up! So you can get into trouble

00:20:11.250 --> 00:20:15.990
Well, I don’t believe that the carefree 10th prince was able to organize high treason

00:20:15.990 --> 00:20:19.300
The 4th Prince behaves like the Emperor's dog

00:20:19.300 --> 00:20:22.460
He seems to like it.
You must know something

00:20:22.460 --> 00:20:23.990
Just eat, eat

00:20:27.750 --> 00:20:31.010
I found a ship, sailing in 5 days

00:20:32.080 --> 00:20:34.300
- Where from?
- This...

00:20:35.020 --> 00:20:39.000
Four different ships depart on the same day

00:20:39.000 --> 00:20:41.000
Not sure which one they'll take

00:20:44.250 --> 00:20:49.070
You're not seriously going to catch Eun, are you?

00:20:52.000 --> 00:20:53.570
Don't you trust me?

00:20:53.570 --> 00:20:55.540
I don't trust the 3rd brother

00:20:55.540 --> 00:20:59.660
This man became an emperor by manipulating people and exploiting their weaknesses

00:21:00.450 --> 00:21:02.320
His future looks bleak

00:21:02.320 --> 00:21:04.970
Find out if Eun contacted anyone

00:21:06.080 --> 00:21:07.450
To Jeong, for example

00:21:07.450 --> 00:21:10.810
Perhaps due to the fact that Uka had common affairs with the 3rd brother,

00:21:10.810 --> 00:21:12.760
they say he never went anywhere

00:21:13.950 --> 00:21:17.250
Who would have thought that he would return alive?

00:21:21.400 --> 00:21:22.430
Woo Hee

00:21:28.270 --> 00:21:30.160
Long time no see

00:21:30.160 --> 00:21:33.430
Yes. Baek Ah told me that you came back

00:21:34.190 --> 00:21:35.910
Hae Soo would be glad to see you

00:21:35.910 --> 00:21:38.200
Maybe I'll meet her soon

00:21:38.200 --> 00:21:41.000
I'm going back to the gisaeng house

00:21:42.180 --> 00:21:43.250
Gisaeng house?

00:21:44.080 --> 00:21:45.510
You didn't say that!

00:21:45.510 --> 00:21:47.610
How long can I depend on you?

00:21:47.610 --> 00:21:51.450
I won't be a gisaeng, I just want to learn how to dance

00:21:51.450 --> 00:21:52.640
Don't worry so much

00:22:07.060 --> 00:22:08.850
It's late, where are you going?

00:22:10.920 --> 00:22:12.600
And you're really interested in me

00:22:12.600 --> 00:22:17.800
It feels like you are behind everything

00:22:19.130 --> 00:22:21.220
I was wondering if you visited it again

00:22:23.900 --> 00:22:26.140
What made you think that?

00:22:26.140 --> 00:22:31.210
The late emperor was addicted to mercury for at least two years

00:22:31.690 --> 00:22:35.110
It seemed that Vaughn was the most suitable for the role of suspect,

00:22:35.940 --> 00:22:38.410
but everything was too perfectly planned

00:22:39.380 --> 00:22:41.410
This doesn't sound like Vaughn.

00:22:43.050 --> 00:22:44.620
But if it's you...

00:22:48.540 --> 00:22:50.840
It's strange that the emperor left you alone

00:22:51.860 --> 00:22:55.840
Such a person would have gotten rid of you long ago

00:22:57.150 --> 00:22:58.970
You got rid of the 10th Prince's family

00:22:58.970 --> 00:23:00.790
and from one clan from Songak

00:23:03.050 --> 00:23:08.040
I wonder who could do it
except for such a smart person like you

00:23:09.080 --> 00:23:12.500
You were always suspicious of me

00:23:21.610 --> 00:23:22.840
You

00:23:24.360 --> 00:23:26.870
really led our brother to death?

00:23:28.110 --> 00:23:29.450
What about you?

00:23:30.770 --> 00:23:35.060
Will you become a dog and kill Eun?

00:23:39.780 --> 00:23:43.430
We both spin to survive

00:23:44.760 --> 00:23:49.530
This is the fate of the prince who did not become emperor

00:23:51.960 --> 00:23:55.340
To defend yourself, you must submit

00:23:56.020 --> 00:23:58.760
I don't know what made you change

00:24:00.810 --> 00:24:06.440
I didn't poison the late emperor

00:24:09.350 --> 00:24:10.810
Is this answer enough?

00:24:44.680 --> 00:24:48.250
Why did you put mercury in the emperor's bath?

00:24:51.450 --> 00:24:53.120
I didn't do that

00:24:54.610 --> 00:24:56.940
Will you confess when they start torturing you?

00:24:57.610 --> 00:24:58.710
Then

00:25:00.440 --> 00:25:02.810
I would say that you ordered me to do this

00:25:02.810 --> 00:25:06.230
They ordered to do this because they wanted to get the throne

00:25:08.020 --> 00:25:10.040
I'll say so even if I die

00:25:11.490 --> 00:25:13.580
And you really are amazing

00:25:14.150 --> 00:25:17.260
I guess you've always been like this

00:25:18.410 --> 00:25:19.580
funny

00:25:21.430 --> 00:25:23.290
I won't get rid of you

00:25:24.040 --> 00:25:27.540
You are the best bait
which I can control my brothers

00:25:28.650 --> 00:25:29.880
Please

00:25:32.400 --> 00:25:34.990
tell me who put mercury in the water

00:25:35.650 --> 00:25:38.930
Do you think I know who did this?

00:25:39.780 --> 00:25:42.460
Even if I find out, I won't be able to tell anyone about it.

00:25:42.460 --> 00:25:47.000
If you say that I killed the emperor, that will be the end for me.

00:25:48.550 --> 00:25:50.330
So I'd like to know

00:25:54.180 --> 00:25:55.430
Who was it?

00:26:01.100 --> 00:26:04.480
Your Majesty!
The 8th Prince has come to see you

00:26:04.480 --> 00:26:08.040
How did he come so on time?

00:26:09.370 --> 00:26:10.680
What?

00:26:29.570 --> 00:26:31.090
Greetings, Your Majesty

00:26:33.060 --> 00:26:35.600
I have a question for you.
It's good that you came

00:26:36.510 --> 00:26:38.750
Hae Soo is dying of curiosity

00:26:39.400 --> 00:26:44.020
Who put mercury in the water of the late emperor?

00:26:54.010 --> 00:26:56.330
I believe he died due to illness

00:26:56.330 --> 00:26:57.780
Isn't that right?

00:26:59.380 --> 00:27:00.810
Yes, yes

00:27:01.420 --> 00:27:03.500
He died due to illness

00:27:27.670 --> 00:27:30.390
I heard you saw what happened to the late emperor

00:27:32.620 --> 00:27:34.040
It must be terrible

00:27:34.040 --> 00:27:36.700
He was my big brother

00:27:37.540 --> 00:27:41.380
The man who caused him to die so horribly...

00:27:45.280 --> 00:27:46.450
Who was it?

00:27:52.240 --> 00:27:53.730
Your Highness,

00:27:55.900 --> 00:27:58.200
You have nothing to do with this, do you?

00:28:02.720 --> 00:28:05.820
I didn't raise my son to be a traitor

00:28:05.820 --> 00:28:07.390
This is such a humiliation on your part!

00:28:09.930 --> 00:28:13.710
I must become a traitor
to protect you and our family!

00:28:14.250 --> 00:28:15.680
Is it because of Hae Soo?

00:28:16.960 --> 00:28:21.410
I'm asking if Hae Soo had any
attitude towards the decisions you made?

00:28:26.660 --> 00:28:30.160
Yes. I thought about her

00:28:33.410 --> 00:28:34.890
It's because of her

00:28:37.510 --> 00:28:38.580
Su said...

00:28:40.210 --> 00:28:43.540
I tried to have everything and it was wrong. But why?

00:28:48.680 --> 00:28:50.390
I wanted to save my family and my heart

00:28:50.390 --> 00:28:51.530
What's the big deal?

00:28:52.460 --> 00:28:56.400
Mother, you told me to live correctly.
I did as you told

00:28:59.370 --> 00:29:01.200
Why am I still alone?

00:29:05.020 --> 00:29:07.030
Uk...

00:29:07.030 --> 00:29:08.910
I have already started my journey

00:29:11.070 --> 00:29:13.170
I will follow it and achieve what I want

00:29:15.420 --> 00:29:17.670
No more being a fool and losing what I want

00:29:29.860 --> 00:29:32.280
I didn't do anything wrong

00:29:48.520 --> 00:29:49.630
Su!

00:29:58.090 --> 00:29:59.840
I heard the emperor called you to his chambers

00:29:59.840 --> 00:30:01.400
I was afraid that something happened to you

00:30:01.400 --> 00:30:04.490
I don't think he's going to kill me or banish me

00:30:07.220 --> 00:30:09.370
He wants to use you as bait to control me

00:30:12.710 --> 00:30:13.750
Nothing

00:30:14.610 --> 00:30:18.330
Even so, the main thing is that you are safe

00:30:19.530 --> 00:30:23.070
What you were talking about earlier

00:30:23.070 --> 00:30:26.110
What will happen to the people you are looking for?

00:30:31.170 --> 00:30:32.420
In truth...

00:30:35.420 --> 00:30:36.890
I'm looking for Eun

00:30:39.750 --> 00:30:42.090
The Emperor wants to find him and kill him

00:30:43.100 --> 00:30:45.150
But I have to do my best
to help him escape

00:30:46.840 --> 00:30:47.950
Yes

00:30:49.280 --> 00:30:52.630
Don't worry, I'll find him

00:31:10.890 --> 00:31:12.200
Chi Mon!

00:31:18.590 --> 00:31:21.350
The star of the 10th prince shines over the palace

00:31:22.250 --> 00:31:23.940
You should look again

00:31:23.940 --> 00:31:25.530
I've already looked everywhere

00:31:25.530 --> 00:31:27.910
And I went to Damiwon, but Eun wasn’t there

00:31:29.570 --> 00:31:31.310
This can't happen

00:31:34.540 --> 00:31:36.970
How much can I trust you in times like these?

00:31:38.000 --> 00:31:40.740
Did you know that Mu would die like this?

00:31:40.740 --> 00:31:43.710
Did you know that the 3rd brother would become emperor?

00:31:46.380 --> 00:31:50.340
Can you imagine what it's like to know but just observe?

00:31:51.220 --> 00:31:53.610
This is the punishment for those who read Heaven

00:31:54.460 --> 00:31:57.860
However, even I was surprised by the appearance of the 3rd prince

00:31:57.980 --> 00:32:00.980
He was born under the star of one who would commit treason, no more

00:32:02.030 --> 00:32:04.440
But something has completely changed

00:32:04.440 --> 00:32:05.690
The course of events has gone astray

00:32:06.910 --> 00:32:10.960
What changes led to the 3rd prince becoming emperor?

00:32:12.370 --> 00:32:13.590
Curious

00:32:24.740 --> 00:32:27.240
Beware the 4th Prince

00:32:28.500 --> 00:32:30.260
4th Prince...

00:32:31.040 --> 00:32:33.220
Beware of him

00:32:35.470 --> 00:32:36.790
Brother?

00:32:41.660 --> 00:32:43.070
That's what Hae Soo told me

00:32:44.680 --> 00:32:46.770
"Beware the 4th Prince"

00:32:48.250 --> 00:32:50.400
She told me not to try to stop him.

00:32:53.020 --> 00:32:54.280
Everything is as she said

00:32:56.800 --> 00:32:58.400
He takes everything

00:33:00.760 --> 00:33:03.280
No matter what I do...

00:33:05.510 --> 00:33:07.240
he takes it away

00:33:11.340 --> 00:33:12.450
Why?

00:33:14.620 --> 00:33:16.050
What should I do?

00:33:27.720 --> 00:33:28.870
Where is Court Lady He?

00:33:29.820 --> 00:33:31.050
Sorry

00:33:35.330 --> 00:33:36.460
Hey you

00:33:38.160 --> 00:33:40.050
Do you know where Court Lady He is?

00:33:43.170 --> 00:33:44.370
Stop

00:33:45.610 --> 00:33:48.250
What kind of terrible manners are these?

00:33:50.930 --> 00:33:52.620
Sorry

00:33:59.490 --> 00:34:00.730
Daughter-in-law?

00:34:03.440 --> 00:34:05.120
It's you, right?

00:34:05.750 --> 00:34:07.430
It's you

00:34:13.590 --> 00:34:15.800
We must leave the palace
to get to the ship

00:34:15.800 --> 00:34:19.250
Are you kidding? There are no other doors here

00:34:19.250 --> 00:34:21.990
North, south, west, east. There are no easy ways

00:34:22.290 --> 00:34:25.230
There are even more guards here now than when we entered.

00:34:25.490 --> 00:34:29.240
Yo seized the throne, and now he is afraid of getting hit

00:34:30.370 --> 00:34:32.160
I'm ashamed that he is my brother

00:34:32.160 --> 00:34:34.770
If only we had a Chi Mon flying machine

00:34:36.040 --> 00:34:38.900
Or a hole in the ground

00:34:41.000 --> 00:34:43.410
Hole? There is one

00:34:44.180 --> 00:34:45.870
There is a way out!

00:35:06.830 --> 00:35:08.010
Su!

00:35:12.390 --> 00:35:15.830
I would like to say goodbye to my father

00:35:16.230 --> 00:35:19.580
Do you think I can contact him through Choi Chi Mon?

00:35:19.580 --> 00:35:20.840
It's dangerous

00:35:20.840 --> 00:35:23.510
The astronomer is also close to the 4th prince

00:35:27.490 --> 00:35:29.310
I've already thought about this

00:35:29.970 --> 00:35:32.370
Why don't you trust the 4th prince?

00:35:33.330 --> 00:35:35.040
You have a special relationship

00:35:36.450 --> 00:35:38.470
I have my reasons

00:35:38.990 --> 00:35:42.510
If you're doing this because of us, I'm grateful.

00:35:43.980 --> 00:35:45.730
Still, I think it's wrong

00:35:46.620 --> 00:35:49.330
I know there are bad rumors surrounding the 4th Prince

00:35:49.330 --> 00:35:52.070
But he is not the one who can grab a person for no reason

00:35:52.070 --> 00:35:54.220
Unless you had a bad experience yourself

00:35:54.220 --> 00:35:57.090
But how can you not trust the person you like?

00:36:00.770 --> 00:36:01.990
You're right

00:36:03.050 --> 00:36:04.840
You're right, madam

00:36:06.660 --> 00:36:10.170
I was so stupid. I have never tried to verify anything from personal experience.

00:36:12.540 --> 00:36:14.740
I'll pay a visit to the astronomer

00:36:26.650 --> 00:36:29.050
Astronomer?

00:36:29.730 --> 00:36:31.230
Astronomer?

00:37:35.040 --> 00:37:37.370
Why do you carry a hairpin with you?

00:37:38.200 --> 00:37:39.270
Just like that

00:37:40.880 --> 00:37:43.820
But you must definitely return it

00:37:43.820 --> 00:37:46.370
She doesn't look new

00:37:48.010 --> 00:37:50.390
Does it belong to your beloved?

00:37:53.050 --> 00:37:56.310
I thought you were only interested in fights

00:37:57.640 --> 00:37:59.870
Curious who she is

00:38:06.510 --> 00:38:10.900
The one who put her life on the line for me

00:38:15.040 --> 00:38:17.320
She even covered me with her body to save me

00:38:19.160 --> 00:38:21.770
Fuck off! Get out, you idiots!

00:38:21.770 --> 00:38:24.430
What are you staring at? If you come closer, you're screwed!

00:38:24.430 --> 00:38:26.860
Fuck off! Get out of here!

00:38:26.870 --> 00:38:31.150
I remember in windless silence

00:38:31.910 --> 00:38:38.150
And I smile because I love the sunshine...

00:38:40.960 --> 00:38:43.800
One day I saw her sing

00:38:46.510 --> 00:38:47.850
Then I realized

00:38:49.360 --> 00:38:52.980
I wanted her to sing just for me someday

00:38:53.800 --> 00:38:55.130
It all started with such desires

00:38:56.620 --> 00:38:57.840
Do these feelings mean

00:38:59.460 --> 00:39:03.060
that you like someone?

00:39:05.200 --> 00:39:06.980
Exactly these!

00:39:07.180 --> 00:39:10.560
I've been through it, I know

00:39:11.710 --> 00:39:12.940
Did you pass?

00:39:25.100 --> 00:39:27.410
When my elder sister was chosen as the future wife of the emperor,

00:39:27.410 --> 00:39:30.770
all the girls from influential clans played with her

00:39:30.770 --> 00:39:35.120
Even then I felt much more comfortable in my armor

00:39:35.280 --> 00:39:38.890
For other children, I was like from another world

00:39:39.090 --> 00:39:41.770
I like to fight on the field

00:39:48.930 --> 00:39:50.250
Don't cry

00:39:52.030 --> 00:39:54.150
Don't like this flower ring?

00:40:01.450 --> 00:40:02.630
This is weird

00:40:02.630 --> 00:40:05.730
All pretty girls love flower rings

00:40:06.800 --> 00:40:09.890
You'll love them too, right?

00:40:17.570 --> 00:40:21.210
If you love someone for real, you will never confuse this feeling

00:40:21.210 --> 00:40:23.520
Don't worry about it and go for it

00:40:23.520 --> 00:40:24.940
I will support you

00:40:27.450 --> 00:40:29.700
My first love became the only and true one

00:40:30.450 --> 00:40:31.960
Since I will share my luck with you,

00:40:31.960 --> 00:40:34.570
and your love will be mutual, your highness

00:40:43.940 --> 00:40:45.800
Fai-ting!

00:40:48.200 --> 00:40:49.910
Greetings, Your Majesty

00:41:05.740 --> 00:41:07.960
Sorry for coming so late

00:41:07.960 --> 00:41:10.140
Please accept my congratulations

00:41:11.080 --> 00:41:13.450
I was just about to call you

00:41:13.450 --> 00:41:15.650
I have news about your marriage

00:41:21.040 --> 00:41:23.000
I will send you to the Khitans

00:41:24.840 --> 00:41:25.880
What?

00:41:26.660 --> 00:41:29.640
The former emperor promised them Princess Gyeong-hwa

00:41:29.640 --> 00:41:31.990
And then he married So

00:41:32.820 --> 00:41:37.060
So I promised that I would send them a bride,
which will have the same high status

00:41:41.100 --> 00:41:44.320
Congratulations on your wedding, Yong Hwa

00:41:46.730 --> 00:41:51.350
Why is everyone who sits on this throne threatening to marry me?

00:41:51.350 --> 00:41:54.960
It doesn't matter if it's the person who gave birth to me or who grew up with me.

00:41:55.650 --> 00:41:56.940
You're all the same

00:41:58.460 --> 00:42:02.260
You think there is no better way to control a woman

00:42:03.740 --> 00:42:04.970
You disappointed me

00:42:04.970 --> 00:42:09.140
You're not so greedy as to want to become an empress, are you?

00:42:10.700 --> 00:42:14.270
Your brother betrayed me and you were on his side

00:42:15.960 --> 00:42:17.500
I can't

00:42:19.250 --> 00:42:21.080
to have such relatives in your home

00:42:45.100 --> 00:42:48.830
Plus, I have someone in mind

00:42:50.150 --> 00:42:51.650
Without Su

00:42:53.190 --> 00:42:55.100
there is no future for me

00:42:56.250 --> 00:43:00.180
I'm nothing without her

00:43:43.950 --> 00:43:45.830
It's so boring here

00:43:45.830 --> 00:43:48.550
From a young age I ran around the palace

00:43:48.550 --> 00:43:51.130
And now I can’t leave these chambers anywhere?

00:43:51.840 --> 00:43:53.820
At least you can go out

00:43:53.820 --> 00:43:56.370
How many days have passed?

00:43:59.620 --> 00:44:01.700
Would you like to take a bath?

00:44:02.760 --> 00:44:06.190
Hae Soo doesn't allow the court ladies into the bathhouse at night, so everything will be fine

00:44:52.030 --> 00:44:53.340
How do you like it?

00:44:54.620 --> 00:44:57.380
Wow! How great!

00:44:57.380 --> 00:44:59.590
Like real!

00:45:00.820 --> 00:45:05.000
Okay, I'll show you all my skills

00:45:12.560 --> 00:45:15.470
Attention, march!

00:45:54.380 --> 00:45:56.190
Yes! I won!

00:45:56.190 --> 00:45:58.370
Did you see it? I won again!

00:46:04.810 --> 00:46:06.170
Give me your hand here

00:46:22.860 --> 00:46:25.340
My hand already hurts a lot from hitting you.

00:46:28.240 --> 00:46:29.460
Why does it hurt so much?

00:46:31.640 --> 00:46:32.700
Oh yes

00:46:34.850 --> 00:46:37.560
I was going to give this to you and forgot

00:46:39.930 --> 00:46:40.960
You...

00:46:42.500 --> 00:46:45.770
Did you remember to take this in all this chaos?

00:46:45.770 --> 00:46:48.450
This is your favorite thing

00:46:49.400 --> 00:46:51.130
Your slingshot

00:47:07.220 --> 00:47:09.060
What kind of prince am I?

00:47:11.370 --> 00:47:15.940
I would like to open the biggest new items store in Songak

00:47:16.580 --> 00:47:17.770
This was my dream

00:47:17.770 --> 00:47:19.680
You can do it

00:47:19.680 --> 00:47:24.080
We can go to Tamra and you can open your own shop, Your Highness

00:47:24.300 --> 00:47:26.150
And I will teach martial arts

00:47:26.790 --> 00:47:27.860
What do you think?

00:47:50.060 --> 00:47:52.180
I didn't forget to take this thing

00:47:55.840 --> 00:47:56.970
Yes

00:47:58.990 --> 00:48:01.200
I'm sure Hae Soo will like it

00:48:01.200 --> 00:48:02.530
This is for you

00:48:04.200 --> 00:48:08.570
Yong Hwa asked what kind of girl doesn't have a bag of incense

00:48:10.380 --> 00:48:13.530
You're putting your husband in an awkward position.

00:48:20.650 --> 00:48:22.770
Don't you like it?

00:48:25.080 --> 00:48:26.550
This is weird

00:48:26.550 --> 00:48:29.970
They say all the pretty girls love it

00:48:32.140 --> 00:48:33.280
This is weird

00:48:33.280 --> 00:48:36.510
All pretty girls love flower rings

00:48:39.900 --> 00:48:43.100
I'm not saying you're beautiful

00:48:43.100 --> 00:48:47.420
It's just... lately...

00:48:47.420 --> 00:48:49.670
you don't look that bad

00:48:50.200 --> 00:48:52.570
I probably have problems with my eyes

00:48:51.060 --> 00:48:57.080
Maybe I couldn’t say then

00:48:57.080 --> 00:49:02.180
I kept everything a secret, I'm like this

00:49:03.330 --> 00:49:09.210
How did it all start and when did it begin?

00:49:06.020 --> 00:49:08.110
I understand what you want to say

00:49:09.210 --> 00:49:14.760
It's so hard to remember, but now I'm with you

00:49:10.150 --> 00:49:11.940
Even pumpkin flowers -

00:49:13.240 --> 00:49:15.210
these are also flowers

00:49:15.080 --> 00:49:21.210
Do you think the same as me, I wonder?

00:49:20.570 --> 00:49:24.480
I want two sons and two daughters

00:49:21.210 --> 00:49:26.810
This is the only thing that worries me now

00:49:25.210 --> 00:49:26.580
And nothing else!

00:49:27.130 --> 00:49:33.080
This all looks so much like love, since I didn’t know

00:49:27.550 --> 00:49:31.630
Will a kiss make me pregnant?

00:49:33.360 --> 00:49:38.880
Now throw away your worries and hug

00:49:39.230 --> 00:49:45.660
If the heart is beating, it's love, yes

00:49:42.380 --> 00:49:45.220
I should have been nice and lived like that from the start

00:49:45.710 --> 00:49:51.530
Then just admit it to me

00:49:50.950 --> 00:49:52.150
Let's go inside

00:49:52.950 --> 00:49:56.150
You'll freeze to death before the Emperor catches us.

00:49:53.560 --> 00:49:58.160
All the time we were far away

00:49:57.520 --> 00:50:00.800
Wait! Am I already expecting a baby?

00:49:58.160 --> 00:50:03.630
I want to love you so much

00:50:03.550 --> 00:50:04.750
Hold on

00:50:04.230 --> 00:50:10.660
Should I confess to heaven that I love him?

00:50:11.010 --> 00:50:16.330
You are my secret love

00:50:16.860 --> 00:50:19.980
I love it!

00:50:19.980 --> 00:50:25.930
This all looks so much like love, since I didn’t know

00:50:26.210 --> 00:50:31.730
Now throw away your worries and hug

00:50:32.080 --> 00:50:38.510
If the heart is beating, it's love, yes

00:50:38.560 --> 00:50:44.380
Then just admit it to me

00:50:45.330 --> 00:50:48.810
What is there for you

00:50:49.730 --> 00:50:53.080
just me

00:51:10.880 --> 00:51:14.440
Lady, there must have been a ghost here

00:51:17.180 --> 00:51:19.870
I'm sure I cleaned here before I went to bed.

00:51:22.400 --> 00:51:24.190
Was someone here?

00:51:25.180 --> 00:51:26.930
I made them

00:51:27.500 --> 00:51:29.530
I thought I could decorate Damiwon with them

00:51:32.450 --> 00:51:33.470
Clear

00:51:35.490 --> 00:51:36.980
How did he make them?

00:51:56.190 --> 00:51:57.420
Hello

00:51:57.420 --> 00:51:59.570
I'll prepare the maids
who will serve you

00:51:59.570 --> 00:52:01.400
I came to talk to you

00:52:06.870 --> 00:52:07.940
Yes

00:52:09.030 --> 00:52:10.390
This way please

00:52:34.090 --> 00:52:36.100
Leave So

00:52:37.650 --> 00:52:40.300
I know what you did to Uk

00:52:40.860 --> 00:52:44.110
I know you didn't tell So about this and now he's bewitched by you

00:52:44.600 --> 00:52:49.170
I don't want to see anything like this anymore
misbehavior, so leave him

00:52:51.030 --> 00:52:53.200
Then I won't create problems either

00:52:54.520 --> 00:52:57.300
Do you want to get married and leave the palace?

00:52:57.720 --> 00:52:59.100
I'll do it for you

00:52:59.780 --> 00:53:03.860
I can marry you into a family that is almost on the same level as the imperial one.

00:53:04.840 --> 00:53:08.170
Marriage may be your goal, Your Highness, but not mine.

00:53:09.150 --> 00:53:11.230
Thanks to me he is happy

00:53:12.400 --> 00:53:17.390
Next to him I feel important, that's why I want to marry him

00:53:20.900 --> 00:53:23.150
If he's still determined,

00:53:24.050 --> 00:53:26.100
I have no reason to cheat on myself

00:53:27.840 --> 00:53:29.510
I won't leave him

00:53:30.510 --> 00:53:34.440
Now I know exactly why I always hated you

00:53:35.360 --> 00:53:37.690
For you feelings and marriage -

00:53:38.620 --> 00:53:40.470
these are just stupid games

00:53:41.450 --> 00:53:43.770
And life and death depend on them for me

00:53:50.960 --> 00:53:53.510
Don't be so sure that you won't change

00:53:54.010 --> 00:53:57.490
No one says that in the palace

00:54:00.640 --> 00:54:02.360
You'll regret it

00:54:02.360 --> 00:54:06.550
I promise I'll make you regret it

00:54:41.450 --> 00:54:44.570
General Park Soo-kyung and astronomer Choi Chi-mon

00:54:44.570 --> 00:54:48.680
They have military and religious power and support Wang So

00:54:49.960 --> 00:54:52.780
You must get rid of the 4th prince quickly

00:54:54.100 --> 00:54:56.920
Not long ago we were planning Wang Gu's rebellion

00:54:57.410 --> 00:54:59.630
Besides, So and I have the same mother.

00:55:00.450 --> 00:55:03.860
To attack him, you need to choose the right time

00:55:05.790 --> 00:55:09.530
Then you should separate Park Soo Kyung and Choi Chi Mon

00:55:20.040 --> 00:55:21.270
What is this?!

00:55:38.080 --> 00:55:41.090
I want to make things easier for you two

00:55:42.820 --> 00:55:44.610
- What?
- In return,

00:55:44.610 --> 00:55:48.880
if my plan doesn't work,
cancel my marriage with the Khitan

00:56:01.360 --> 00:56:03.830
I was told that you know where Eun is

00:56:03.830 --> 00:56:06.030
Where is he?

00:56:06.030 --> 00:56:09.900
Senior court lady Hae Soo hid Eun and his wife in Damiwon

00:56:09.900 --> 00:56:11.540
How did you know?

00:56:11.940 --> 00:56:13.540
Did you see it yourself?

00:56:13.940 --> 00:56:17.840
Even as a child, Eun knew how to fold things from canvases

00:56:17.840 --> 00:56:20.080
Dogs, birds

00:56:20.380 --> 00:56:22.810
And he made ships out of paper

00:56:23.710 --> 00:56:27.220
Damiwon is teeming with Eun's crafts

00:56:27.220 --> 00:56:29.350
I'm sure

00:56:42.770 --> 00:56:46.750
Follow this path to the cave, Jeong will be waiting outside

00:56:47.510 --> 00:56:50.050
He will help you get to the ship safely

00:56:52.440 --> 00:56:53.810
This is dried meat

00:56:54.810 --> 00:56:55.970
Just in case

00:56:59.280 --> 00:57:00.520
Thank you

00:57:03.340 --> 00:57:04.490
big

00:57:08.130 --> 00:57:10.530
Su, see you when I get back

00:57:11.080 --> 00:57:13.470
Yes I'll be waiting

00:57:13.470 --> 00:57:16.110
By the way, what about your father?

00:57:16.110 --> 00:57:19.160
I left a letter.
I'm sure he will meet you on the way

00:57:25.300 --> 00:57:26.490
Let's go

00:57:37.810 --> 00:57:40.410
Run! Palace guards are everywhere!

00:57:40.410 --> 00:57:42.980
- Jeong...
- I'll stop them, run!

00:57:42.980 --> 00:57:44.040
You too!

00:58:00.060 --> 00:58:03.010
We must arrest the 10th prince. Find him!

00:58:03.010 --> 00:58:04.090
Eat!

00:58:16.380 --> 00:58:18.290
Take the prince another way

00:58:19.610 --> 00:58:20.700
What?

00:58:21.230 --> 00:58:23.830
They can't kill me because of my father

00:58:23.830 --> 00:58:25.840
They have come for you, Your Highness

00:58:25.840 --> 00:58:27.270
You can't

00:58:28.090 --> 00:58:29.550
Let's go together

00:58:34.460 --> 00:58:35.850
I'll be there soon

00:58:40.190 --> 00:58:41.470
I promise

00:58:44.330 --> 00:58:45.450
I trust you

00:58:57.210 --> 00:59:00.500
Like your wife said, we need to run

00:59:01.630 --> 00:59:05.400
I can't. I can't hide behind my wife

00:59:06.210 --> 00:59:07.470
Your Highness!

00:59:13.490 --> 00:59:14.720
What can I do?

00:59:15.640 --> 00:59:17.460
I'm the best for her

00:59:20.950 --> 00:59:23.840
I'm all she has

00:59:46.150 --> 00:59:52.150
As if a free wind will carry you away

00:59:47.000 --> 00:59:54.070
Thanks for watching with us!
Release group MANIA

00:59:47.000 --> 00:59:54.070
http://doramamania.mybb.ru
http://vk.com/doramamania

00:59:52.150 --> 00:59:59.250
I kept looking for the way to you, but I never found it

00:59:54.070 --> 00:59:56.790
Scarlet Hearts: Ryeo

00:59:57.180 --> 01:00:00.850
Why are you whining about the death of a couple of useless slaves?!

00:59:59.780 --> 01:00:07.530
I couldn’t catch the fate that was moving away from me

01:00:01.130 --> 01:00:02.530
I'll kill him

01:00:02.530 --> 01:00:04.560
The inhumanity of brothers who want to kill each other...

01:00:04.560 --> 01:00:07.270
I started it, I will finish it

01:00:07.850 --> 01:00:12.500
So I'll let you go completely

01:00:08.040 --> 01:00:11.060
Jeong wants to take the throne?

01:00:11.060 --> 01:00:13.570
You haven't forgotten me, have you?

01:00:12.500 --> 01:00:18.450
Looking at your footprints when you leave me

01:00:13.570 --> 01:00:14.670
Hae Soo is still with him

01:00:14.670 --> 01:00:18.310
I told you you couldn't trust him when he said he'd be your dog.

01:00:18.450 --> 01:00:27.190
Now I couldn’t hold back my tears

01:00:18.650 --> 01:00:22.510
I'll be the dog that ends his life

01:00:22.510 --> 01:00:25.120
I will become the Emperor of Goryeo
